[{"client_msg_id":"9c904c2e-1cb1-402e-8466-d6df4320512f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あー、それでいいのか、ありがとうございます","ts":"1615118077.430800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lY6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c000d1dd-f9d2-4d37-ab7f-25d541db3f66","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"現在のバッファ限定だと `getline(1, '$')` でもいけますね","ts":"1615118063.430500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VB7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bafa533c-7735-4d27-99c3-25f48cc18e36","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"自分はそうやってる","ts":"1615118046.430000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2bMk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6accaaf-9715-4521-a3d9-84cfc5202966","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"現在のバッファの全行取得って `getbufline(bufnr('%'), '1', '$')` が基本であってるでしょうか","ts":"1615118019.429800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LfX0a"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01QTAL4F5F","text":"\u003c@U01QTAL4F5F\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1615079414.428900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"0ac0f07e-425b-404c-b872-babf1d52fd54","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"`echo nr2char(9)` がなんも表示されなかったから無理かと思ったけどタブだった","ts":"1615056469.428400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D5o9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"756d1bf6-51c4-4c6c-b02e-0873925445cc","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"いけましたｗ ありがとうございます","ts":"1615056432.427900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lXj"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nnr2char({expr} [, {utf8}])                              *nr2char()*\n                コード{expr}で表される1文字からなる文字列を返す。例:  \n                        nr2char(64)             \"@\"を返す\n                        nr2char(32)             \" \"を返す\n                {utf8} を省略、またはゼロを指定すると、現在の 'encoding' が適\n                用される。\"utf-8\" の場合の例:  \n                        nr2char(300)            短音記号つきのIを返す\n                {utf8} に 1 を指定すると、常に utf-8 文字が返る。\n                Note Vim内部では、ファイル中のNUL文字を改行文字(0x0A)に変換し\n                て保持している。そのため、nr2char(10)とすればNUL文字を指定でき\n                る。nr2char(0)は真のNUL文字(文字列の終端)となるので、空文字列\n                を返す。\n                文字の数値のリストを文字列に変換するには:  \n                    let list = [65, 66, 67]\n                    let str = join(map(list, {_, val -\u0026gt; nr2char(val)}), '')\n                結果: \"ABC\"\n \n                |method| としても使用できる:  \n                        GetNumber()-\u0026gt;nr2char()\n```","ts":"1615056279.427600","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"5e3ce0ca-b57b-48e4-8c03-b31caa26012e","type":"message","user":"U01Q0PGSY6N","text":":h nr2char()","ts":"1615056278.427500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"puro","count":3,"users":["U01H161HVPS","U01D9BALEKU","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6F2gr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f60ff0b-6c5f-4bd0-84af-0ca510fe6ee6","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"`\u0026lt;Char-\u0026gt;` を使えばできそうな気もするけどそこまでやるか感はありますね","ts":"1615055998.427200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PEz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"112975ca-595e-4afa-996a-ea26f8d45959","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"私もそれやりましたw","ts":"1615055888.425700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"handshake","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JRYN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b75890b0-6031-4b8e-9242-eb2d4cb3a879","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"wildcharmの中身はasciiコードなんですね\n9が入ってた","ts":"1615055592.425400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eb2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19094c4b-6b60-43ae-8215-db85d6681f33","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"せっかくなんでwildcharmの値を読み込むようにしてみたらうまくいかなかった\n```set wildcharm=\u0026lt;Tab\u0026gt;\ncnoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Tab\u0026gt; '\u0026lt;cmd\u0026gt;set nosmartcase\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;'\n    \\               . \u0026amp;wildcharm\n    \\               . '\u0026lt;cmd\u0026gt;let \u0026amp;smartcase = '..g:smartcase_stashed..'\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;'```","ts":"1615055575.425000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fKty"}]},{"client_msg_id":"161c243e-a321-4b64-855e-2910abc5bad6","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"ですです。値はお好みで :vimsan:","ts":"1615055352.424400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hor"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e47fa17-db61-4e21-b64b-93ef06dd4a9b","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":":goodpoem:","ts":"1615055274.423000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u81t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"637627a4-02e4-4d40-82b5-110af3ac2dd0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"うまくいかないと思ってたらwildcharmはデフォルトないんですね","ts":"1615055241.422700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vgv/D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30dba5bd-32e4-4a7e-bc6f-46da39f7ec6a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"いけました\nありがとうございます","ts":"1615055222.422200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4=N="}]},{"client_msg_id":"1605d598-983c-484a-b883-908129ef0068","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"```set wildcharm=\u0026lt;Tab\u0026gt;\ncnoremap \u0026lt;expr\u0026gt; \u0026lt;Tab\u0026gt; '\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;set nosmartcase\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\u0026lt;Tab\u0026gt;\u0026lt;Cmd\u0026gt;let \u0026amp;smartcase = ' .. \u0026amp;smartcase .. '\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;'```\nこんなのでどうでしょう？","ts":"1615055047.421800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p3Df/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53ba88f7-ba75-4b42-b5b3-d7635e2a04eb","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あー","ts":"1615055005.421400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tf9lt"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *'wildcharm'* *'wcm'*\n'wildcharm' 'wcm'       数値    (既定では空 (0))\n                        グローバル\n        このオプションはオプション 'wildchar' と全く同様に働くが、こちらはマク\n        ロ内でも認識される点が異なっている。|ex-edit-index| を探せば、このオプ\n        ションに適した「予備」コマンドラインキーが見つかるだろう。普通、ユーザー\n        が実際に 'wildcharm' で指定されたキーを打ち込むことはない。自動的に補\n        完モードを呼び出すマッピング内でのみ使うこと。例えば次のようにする。  \n                :set wcm=\u0026lt;C-Z\u0026gt;\n                :cnoremap ss so $vim/sessions/*.vim\u0026lt;C-Z\u0026gt;\n        こうすると \":ss\" と打ち込んだ後でコマンド CTRL-P や CTRL-N が使える。\n```","ts":"1615055003.421300","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"2998b01e-ca54-4954-acdf-a10ee7447459","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":":h wildcharm","ts":"1615055002.421200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C/y2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a8172c5-7b06-4065-879b-8fbea201ca77","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"TABで^Iが入っちゃいますね","ts":"1615054997.420900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QLa+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9fd1bcdc-c48c-41d1-93f3-1fc075aebf24","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"たぶん wildcharm 案件ですね","ts":"1615054994.420600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i3dyC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cf2f9f7-422c-46eb-8375-c760811c686d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"`cnoremap \u0026lt;Tab\u0026gt; \u0026lt;cmd\u0026gt;set nosmartcase\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;\u0026lt;Tab\u0026gt;`\nとりあえずこれはダメっぽい","ts":"1615054972.420200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EB3Lp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6dc04d24-2649-4214-8c29-70c0fa7e43ee","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"cnoremap \u0026lt;TAB\u0026gt; でsmartcaseの退避させるとか","ts":"1615054735.418700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cte"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0bdf9ec-6dd3-422f-a911-c36c96b34c31","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"コマンドライン補完だけに利かすならどうするかな・・","ts":"1615054719.418400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MUJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ca150a8b-6375-4b54-a438-d8217cff8d05","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"pattern関わるけいのコマンドが死ぬか","ts":"1615054711.418200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7dHsC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea6cc41d-d183-40de-b26c-98898ea7fc7b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"たしかに","ts":"1615054699.417700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z98f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2eeee2d-4acc-47f9-9a3d-541a9a900960","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"たぶん`:s` コマンドとかが意図しない挙動になる","ts":"1615054674.417100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KY6VM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e56c7fd2-a5a8-47c1-aa52-10ca0ee994bf","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"それだとちょっと副作用がありそう","ts":"1615054652.416800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ax+E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"966b750f-6329-45d2-9b06-687073e2cde9","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"```augroup cmdline_nsmartcase_gruop\n  autocmd!\n  autocmd CmdlineEnter : let g:smartcase_stashed=\u0026amp;smartcase | set nosmartcase\n  autocmd CmdlineLeave : let \u0026amp;smartcase=g:smartcase_stashed\naugroup END```\nこうしました","ts":"1615052616.414900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H38"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2bc72bd-1f7a-483f-a48c-1084790c792f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"む。。。。これは`/`の検索にも効いてしまいますね","ts":"1615052265.414700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e+xDf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b52569b-a5b3-4722-be6e-89205d28d820","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"できました！\nありがとうございます","ts":"1615052080.414200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s2A/x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d18955e9-eab3-449e-923a-3f6bbe89993c","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"`nosmartcase` でよさそうですね。","ts":"1615050128.413600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s6l8o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d30cac1-7160-4228-b2ab-f9ac4f0d2e86","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"あー、なるほど。そういうことか。","ts":"1615050112.413300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yq7wR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"418b469f-c6a1-4898-acef-883569bb1e00","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"そうであれば `smartcase` ですね。 `:set nosmartcase` すればでるはずです。","ts":"1615049922.413000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XLi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d333dec-9c38-45e9-88cc-66ca1ab9e5fe","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"おそらくですが、 `:ctrlpbo\u0026lt;tab\u0026gt;` だと `:CtrlPBookmark` が出せるけど `:CtrlPb\u0026lt;tab\u0026gt;` だと出せないって事ですかね。","ts":"1615049873.412500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rAjC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"692a6ccf-351b-48ec-aa13-7b0268d4bdb7","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"ちょっと言わんとすることがわからないかもです","ts":"1615049391.411500","thread_ts":"1615049391.411500","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1615051158.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EHEGC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d58b5c7-d95d-4784-ab1a-8f06365f0b96","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"例えば`:ctrlp\u0026lt;TAB\u0026gt;` すると`:CtrlP` になって候補が出るじゃないですか、そうすると次の文字大文字じゃないと補完が掛かってくれないのが毎回気になってます","ts":"1615048901.411300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NV2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4050f45b-2319-42ce-b03d-1aee327d90dd","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"コマンドラインのコマンド名補完ってignorecaseできますか？","ts":"1615048819.410000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IvUN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0506e6b3-3aa1-4bcd-bb8c-ae9cb2eb68c6","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"（なんかつれない受け答えになってたのでひっそりと編集しておく・・）","ts":"1615051207.413800","thread_ts":"1615049391.411500","parent_user_id":"U01H161HVPS","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YWDvp"}]}]
